        <section class="c-page__body" id="maincontent">
            <section class="c-container c-container--has-bg-color u-pure-white-bg c-container--inset "
    id="details">

    
    <section class="c-container__blocks">

        <div class="o-layout o-layout--center">
                            <div class="o-layout__item u-2/3@desktop">
    <div class="c-col c-col-text-area u-transparent-bg" >
    	
        
                    <p class="lead-p c-drop-cap">Join us for a brand-new, interactive, craft-a-long retelling of Shakespeare’s <em>Macbeth</em>, created by award-winning playwright <strong>Hannah Khalil</strong> and brought to life entirely with the recycled cardboard magic of designer <strong>Sam Wilde</strong>.</p>
<p>Created for families and young audiences aged 7+, this exciting make-along production is created by <strong>Cardboard Adventures</strong> and <strong>Shakespeare’s Globe</strong>, in partnership with <strong>Chichester Festival Theatre</strong> and <strong>Leeds Playhouse</strong>, continuing a shared commitment to making classic stories accessible, imaginative and fun for new generations.</p>
<p>Directed by<strong> Ian Nicholson</strong>, MakeBeth bursts with live music, puppetry, and hands-on creativity, transforming Shakespeare’s darkest tragedy into a joyful, laugh-out-loud cardBARD adventure.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-224967" src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/Logo-black-small.jpg?fit=300%2C300" alt="Cardboard Adventures logo." width="175" height="110" srcset="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/Logo-black-small.jpg?w=800 800w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/Logo-black-small.jpg?resize=300%2C188 300w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/Logo-black-small.jpg?resize=768%2C480 768w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/Logo-black-small.jpg?resize=16%2C10 16w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/Logo-black-small.jpg?resize=480%2C300 480w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/Logo-black-small.jpg?resize=640%2C400 640w" sizes="(max-width: 175px) 100vw, 175px" />   <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-94590" src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/06/LPH-Logo-Web-CMYK.jpg?fit=300%2C300" alt="" width="88" height="115" srcset="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/06/LPH-Logo-Web-CMYK.jpg?w=764 764w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2022/06/LPH-Logo-Web-CMYK.jpg?resize=229%2C300 229w" sizes="(max-width: 88px) 100vw, 88px" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-225583" src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?fit=300%2C300" alt="Chichester Festival Theatre logo" width="216" height="115" srcset="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?w=2560 2560w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?resize=300%2C160 300w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?resize=1024%2C546 1024w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?resize=768%2C410 768w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?resize=1536%2C819 1536w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?resize=2048%2C1093 2048w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?resize=1400%2C747 1400w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CFT-Logo-Black--Solid-Background--Must-sit-top-left-corner--RGB-scaled.jpg?resize=16%2C10 16w" sizes="(max-width: 216px) 100vw, 216px" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-224968" src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?fit=300%2C300" alt="Chomp shop logo." width="201" height="99" srcset="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?w=2560 2560w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?resize=300%2C148 300w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?resize=1024%2C506 1024w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?resize=768%2C380 768w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?resize=1536%2C759 1536w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?resize=2048%2C1012 2048w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/CHOMPSHOP_LOGOS-07-1-scaled.png?resize=1400%2C692 1400w" sizes="(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-224965 size-medium" src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/lottery_Logo_Black-RGB.png?fit=300%2C300" alt="Supported using public funding for arts council England. Lottery funded. Logos." width="300" height="81" srcset="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/lottery_Logo_Black-RGB.png?w=1191 1191w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/lottery_Logo_Black-RGB.png?resize=300%2C81 300w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/lottery_Logo_Black-RGB.png?resize=1024%2C275 1024w, https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2026/05/lottery_Logo_Black-RGB.png?resize=768%2C206 768w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
