                            data-dialog-content='&lt;p&gt;Angus is a Scottish/Finnish actor and musician who trained at Rose Bruford College, graduating in 2022. Before becoming an actor, he worked as a bassist in Glasgow playing with artists such as KT Tunstall.&lt;/p&gt;
