                                data-dialog-title='Sam Wilde'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Sam Wilde is a multi-award-winning Set, Costume, and Puppetry Designer based in Bristol. Previous work at Shakespeare&#8217;s Globe includes <em>The Fir Tree</em>.</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/samuel-wilde/">View full biography</a>
