                            <h3 class="c-col-bio__role u-h3">Director</h3>
                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Ian Nicholson'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Ian Nicholson is an award-winning theatre director whose productions have been seen across the UK and internationally. Trained at the National Theatre Studio, the Central School of Speech and Drama, and École Philippe Gaulier, he creates theatre for children and families.</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/ian-nicholson/">View full biography</a>
                                '

