                            <h3 class="c-col-bio__role u-h3">Writer</h3>
                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Hannah Khalil'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Hannah Khalil is Writer in Residence at Bristol Old Vic (2025-2050). Recent work includes critically acclaimed <em>My English Persian Kitchen</em> which had a sell out run at the Traverse as part of the Edinburgh Festival in August 2024, then transferred to Soho Theatre, London. It returned to London in Autumn 2025 followed by a UK and Irish tour.</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/hannah-khalil/">View full biography</a>
